; cleaned and sanitized","repeat":false,"comment":"4-601.11: (A) EQUIPMENT FOOD-CONTACT SURFACES and UTENSILS shall be clean to sight and touch. \n\nObserved the ice machine interior baffle to have a layer of pink, slimy mold. Discussed with PIC. Inspector showed PIC where mold accumulation is occurring. PIC had staff remove ice from machine and wash, rinse, and sanitize the interior of the unit, including the baffle. Discussed creating a routine cleaning schedule for the interior of the ice machine. COS.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"418839","date":"2022-05-19","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=418839&INSPECTION_NN=418839","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":16,"title":"Food-contact surfaces; cleaned and sanitized","repeat":false,"comment":"4-501.114: Chemical sanitizer for manual or mechanical operation shall meet proper criteria.\n\nOn arrival, the sani bucket used for the prep area of the kitchen is observed less than 100 ppm Quat. Quat should be 200 ppm minimum. Food handling/ prep observed during the inspection. The bucket was remade during the inspection to correct.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"409876","date":"2022-02-22","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=409876&INSPECTION_NN=409876","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"383976","date":"2021-04-20","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=38397